# Sentry on the public landing app

## Project

- Org: `thcargentina` (https://thcargentina.sentry.io)
- Project slug: `ciutatus-public`
- Platform: Next.js (`javascript-nextjs`)
- Team: `ciutatis`
- DSN configured in `apps/landing/.env.local` (and fallback in SDK init)

## Verification (2026-07-11)

- SDK captures + `/monitoring` tunnel posts succeed from the browser.
- Ingest returns **429** `organization:error_usage_exceeded` for thcargentina — events are dropped until org error quota is raised or the billing period resets.
- After quota clears, re-test via `/sentry-example-page`.

## What is instrumented

- Client: `instrumentation-client.ts` — errors, tracing (100%), session replay (100%), logs, feedback widget
- Server: `sentry.server.config.ts` + `instrumentation.ts` `onRequestError`
- Edge: `sentry.edge.config.ts`
- App Router: `app/global-error.tsx`, `app/error.tsx`
- Tunnel: `/monitoring` (ad-blocker bypass)
- Source maps: `withSentryConfig` + `SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN`
- Verify: `/sentry-example-page` (noindex)

## Env

See `apps/landing/.env.example`.
